OL,3,AFour arrested over woman's murder 32
OL,4,Ayears ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of perverting the course of
OL,8,Fjustice in the case of a woman who was
OL,9,Fmurdered 32 years ago.
OL,11,FDoreen Morris, 64, was stabbed to death
OL,12,Fwith a fork after disturbing a burglary
OL,13,Fat her home, Penrhyn Uchaf, on
OL,14,FAnglesey, in 1994, according to a 2023
OL,15,Finquest.
OL,17,FJoseph Carl Westbury denied breaking
OL,18,Finto Doreen's bungalow and was found
OL,19,Fnot guilty of her murder in 1995. He
OL,20,Ftook his life in May 2016.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
